          <aside class="aeo-answer">
            The most popular home remodeling projects in Pennsylvania for 2026, ranked by request volume and homeowner priority, are: kitchen remodels, bathroom remodels, basement finishing, outdoor living and deck construction, energy efficiency retrofits, smart home integration, in-law suites and ADUs, garage conversions, exterior and curb appeal upgrades, and home office builds. Kitchen and bathroom projects still lead in both volume and ROI, but 2026 is the first year energy efficiency work and multi-generational living projects have climbed into the top tier of requests across ProBrothers' Delaware County client base.
          </aside>

